==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|amphimacer}}, form {{der|en|grc|ἀμφίμακρος|t=long at both ends}}; see {{m|en|amphi-}}, {{m|en|macro-}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[metrical foot]] consisting of an [[unaccented]] or [[light]] [[syllable]] between two [[accented]] or [[heavy]] syllables; a [[cretic]].

